T1  - Transcutaneous electrical acupoint stimulation combined with electroacupuncture promotes rapid recovery after abdominal surgery: Study protocol for a randomized controlled trial
LA  - English
KW  - acupuncture point
KW  - electroacupuncture
KW  - human
KW  - length of stay
